Package: tidycreel.connect
Title: Database and File Connections for Tidycreel
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christopher", "Chizinski", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cchizinski2@unl.edu")
Description: Provides connection objects and data loaders for the tidycreel
    creel survey analysis package. Loads data from flat CSV files, from
    DBI-compliant databases including SQL Server via ODBC, and from REST APIs
    described by a caller-supplied profile.
